  prologueLine: The future has died already. Its alarms keep practicing.
  branchLine: Branches route power through rooms that forgot their purpose.
  hubLine: The anchor hums like a generator under a battlefield.
  bossLine: The warden is old code wearing stone like a uniform.
  extractionLine: The choir cuts out. Something beneath it keeps tone.
